      <activity id="d0e3d581-cddb-5cea-a260-1780287b3216" activityNameId="4e7f2fd3-2641-5e57-95f3-7b3eb42b2274" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Rape oil, at regional storage</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Rape oil, at regional storage
Inventory refers to the distribution of 1 kg of rape oil in Switzerland. Rape oil is produced in Switzerland. Distribution to the final consumer (service station) including all necessary transports.;
UUID: 32894a99-8a6d-35dd-9650-c7790ed1048b
This process includes the transport of rape oil from the oil mill to the end user. Operation of storage tanks and equipment. Emissions from evaporation and treatment of effluents.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Distribution of fuels
Time period: undefined
Production volume: Total production of rape oil was approx. 18-20 kt in 2004 in CH
Sampling: Environmental reports and literature. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_32894a99-8a6d-35dd-9650-c7790ed1048b.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
